{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026Pbl5YI0x381794489627.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>被指是黃仁勳婚外情對象的黃樂，曾任職的新加坡雲端服務公司MEGASPEED在黃仁勳事件後首次發聲明，表示會配合美國政府對涉嫌危害國家安全風險的調查。</p><p></p><p>聲明強調，MEGASPEED極為重視符合美國管制出口法律的義務，公司已配合美國商務部工業及安全局的檢查，並已準備好全力配合美國政府其他相關部門的工作。為了進一步確保公司符合法規，已委託具備市場領導地位的美國法律事務所，統計公司的圖形處理器，並獨立核實出口管制的落實情況。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.SING.MEGASPEED-2000.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026Daiy9ytZ5n1794489637.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>去年10月，美國有參議員要求商務部調查MEGASPEED有否轉運輝達晶片，新加坡警方隨後亦展開調查。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T14:03:55.982256+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":261,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T12:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T18:37:38.651504+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T13:57:20.887499+00:00","content_hash":"58990876107b4b0a6f48c49108f71f69ffd1e805544435411577b790eba4dc9a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}